ation is stated.","u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Majapahit"},{"name":"Campaign against Tamiang","from":1340,"to":1355,"outcome":"The ruler list notes that Malik Salahuddin (1340-1355) 'Attacked the Karang Baru Kingdom, Tamiang'; no territorial result is given.","u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Samudera_Pasai_Sultanate"},{"name":"Majapahit attack on Pasai (1390s)","from":1394,"to":1400,"outcome":"No land is said to change hands: the ruler table only notes 'Attacked by Majapahit' against Sultan Zainal Abidin I (1394-1400).","u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Samudera_Pasai_Sultanate"},{"name":"Portuguese occupation of Pasai","from":1521,"to":1524,"outcome":"The Portuguese occupied Pasai from 1521 and evacuated their garrison in 1524.","u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Samudera_Pasai_Sultanate"},{"name":"Aceh conquest of Pasai","from":1520,"to":1524,"outcome":"Ali Mughayat Syah's conquests: 'the conquest of neighboring Daya (1520), Pidie (1521), and Pasai (1524)'; 'in 1524 Pasai was eventually captured and the Portuguese garrison there was expelled' (Ali Mughayat Syah page).","u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ali_Mughayat_Syah"}],"certainty":[{"from":1267,"to":1524,"level":"soft","note":"A coastal sultanate of the north Sumatran river mouths: no surveyed line; the eastern frontier with Peureulak vanishes in 1292."}],"sources":[{"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Samudera_Pasai_Sultanate","title":"Samudera Pasai Sultanate"},{"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Aceh_Sultanate","title":"Aceh Sultanate"},{"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Peureulak_Sultanate","title":"Peureulak Sultanate"},{"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Majapahit","title":"Majapahit"},{"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Regreg_War","title":"Regreg War"},{"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nagarakretagama","title":"Nagarakretagama"},{"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ali_Mughayat_Syah","title":"Ali Mughayat Syah"}]}